  "sourceCode": "# sample_bubble_sort.py\n# Developer's personal algorithm solution\n\ndef bubble_sort():\n    arr = [45, 12, 89, 34, 7, 23, 60]\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):\n            if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:\n                arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]\n    return arr\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    result = bubble_sort()\n    print(\"Sorted array:\", result)\n",
